     "Dear All, <div><br></div><div>Does anyone know if it is possible to implement survSplit in INLA. In my analysis, I want to split  the follow-up time into two e.g the time at age 6 and analyze each time period. In the first time period or analysis will include all individuals in the cohort and follow-up stops at age 6. In the second, follow-up starts at age 6. </div><div><br></div><div>In the survival package, I think this can be achieve with the survSplit function. I tried the following in INLA and got an error. </div><div><br></div><div><i>vet2 &lt;- survSplit(Surv(time, status) ~., veteran,\r\n                   cut=c(60, 120), episode =&quot;timegroup&quot;)<br></i></div><div><i><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">sinla.vet &lt;- <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">inla.surv</span>(</span></span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">vet2</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">$</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">tstart,</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">vet2</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">$</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">time, vet2</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">$</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">status)</span></i></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"><i><br></i></span></div><div><i><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">weibinla.vet &lt;- <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">inla</span>(sinla.vet ~ - trt</span></span>* strata(timegroup)  <span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">,\r\n<a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-survival.html#cb403-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-survival.html%23cb403-2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792438444458000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nJGWmx0-EvyMKdDs-jwPL\"></a>  data = vet2, family = &quot;weibull.surv&quot;,\r\n<a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-survival.html#cb403-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-survival.html%23cb403-3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792438444458000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2stW4u8oHPy_P3cOGeQgAA\"></a>  control.family = <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">list</span>(variant=0))</span></span></i><br></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">The error message was </span></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;background-color:red\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;background-color:red\">Error in inla.surv.1(time,event,time2,truncation): Invalid value for event</span></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;background-color:red\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;background-color:white\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;background-color:white\">Thank you</span></span></div>"
